// Me And Mrs Jones (Billy Paul, 1972)

Tempo 70
Keysig Eb

Groove Metronome2-4
    z * 2
    
Groove DSoulIntro
Cresc mp mf 3

1         Eb
2         Gm7
3         Fm7
// We do the following to give some emphasis to the pickup notes
Truncate 2 Side=Left
4         Eb
Groove DSoulFill
Decresc p 1
Truncate 2 Side=Right
4         B&7
         
Repeat
Label Sign  /// standard DS/Coda stuff

Groove DSoul
Volume m

5      EbM7      / Fm7/Bb
6       Gm7/Eb      /    Fm7/Bb
7       Gm7        F#m7@4.5
8       Fm7
Volume mf
9         /

Groove DSoulSus
Cresc mp mf 4

10        /
11      Fm9/Bb      /   Bb7+
12   Eb6(add9)

Groove DSoulFill

13       G7

If Def CODA
   GoTo TheCODA
Endif

Groove DSoul
Volume m

14       Cm      /    Cm7
15      Gm7
16      Fm7      / Fm7/Bb
17     EbM7      /    G7+

Groove DSoulPlus
Cresc mf 2

18       Cm      /    Cm7
19      Gm7
20       F9

RepeatEnding

Groove DSoulSus
Volume m

21   Fm9/Bb
22        /

RepeatEnd
Decresc mp 2

Groove DSoulSusPlus
23   Fm9/Bb
24        /

Set CODA
Goto Sign

Label TheCoda   /// This is the CODA
Volume m

25       Cm      /    Cm7
26      Gm7
27      Fm7      /    Fm7/Bb
28     EbM7      /    G7+

Decresc mp 4

29       Cm      /    Cm7
30      Gm7
31       F9
32   Fm9/Bb

33        /


Groove DSoulSus
Decresc pppp 4
Repeat
34     EbM7      / FM9/Bb
35   Eb6(add9)      / Fm9/Bb
Groove DSoulEnd
RepeatEnd


